data: {"id": "4bdb35caf1dd4a62-thinking-parallel_evidence-2082", "run_id": "4bdb35caf1dd4a62", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|---|---|\n| **Pod** | `workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` |\n| **Namespace** | `aiops-case-07` |\n| **UID** | `5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26` |\n| **Node** | `node2 / 10.2.0.50` |\n| **Phase** | Running (Pod), Waiting (Container) |\n| **Container** | `app`, Image `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, command `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py` |\n| **Status** | **CrashLoopBackOff** |\n| **Restart Count** | **19** 次 (最近一次 86s 前) |\n| **Exit Code** | **78** |\n| **St", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789076831573, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

